From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MihaZupan <miha@mihubot.xyz>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:10:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] stories: preserve Molly story presentation and reset policy

Port the retained Molly semantic intent directly onto stable Signal 8.34.2.
Source, API, resource and build integration are adapted to this target;
the earlier extraction's unmodified-blob claims do not apply here.

Upstream-baseline: 515db93fb48206d63406cbfb48c5816f6af1d9e2
Prior-version-input: 68a0dcf4c48c1e0ad713cc8a922e3600c89e32be
Semantic-boundary: 20/36

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt
index 89c633c102d227cf30f244f35e8891c353220034..03f83fd92d458a57b522eb86fb814dc2e539dd90 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt
@@ -68,6 +68,11 @@ class StoryOnboardingDownloadJob private constructor(parameters: Parameters) : B
   override fun onFailure() = Unit
 
   override fun onRun() {
+    if (!SignalStore.account.isRegistered) {
+      Log.i(TAG, "Not registered, skipping.")
+      return
+    }
+
     if (SignalStore.story.hasDownloadedOnboardingStory) {
       Log.i(TAG, "Already downloaded onboarding story. Exiting.")
       return
